# radroots_nostr_runtime

`radroots_nostr_runtime` is a private, publication-frozen predecessor package.
Its former client/runtime integration is no longer active by default and must
not receive new consumers. Final source/sink orchestration belongs to
`radroots_sync`; the remaining opt-in predecessor surface is governed by
`RCRV1-DEV-007` and must be removed at its sync-orchestration gate.

## Overview

 * runtime builder, runtime events, and long-lived connection state types;
 * subscription specifications, policies, handles, and traffic-light status
   models;
 * sink abstractions and snapshot types used by higher-level network
   orchestration;
 * quarantined feature-gated predecessor integration retained only for the
   governed removal gate.

